om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIsoxmstyOUQ7kNvwFB_NfO&_nc_oc=AdlXhpsCIzdBmZijtuKZz4YZLIzP2GHIgIv_JEl_JCqkwNzACiG3dqY1afgD6ol8yRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvhhdSG_Sxb83vgaWo567EWvPBRzdZuhqSrgKIBsy1L_w&oe=69A1A26D"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_xS8j-sVIcQQ7kNvwGsmcyd&_nc_oc=Adm_sQcSvp-F-c1lm0MQfyaABJ3H2koomhkpmoafU_Bz9xuzjSgZjQIBwDTJKwphGHc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftIyGUh9WFbru2-o5vyrCl1gUdeV9HRPpJ6VGXiK8pCtQ&oe=69A1A2B7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_fDt2kNJvKEQ7kNvwGJPwUT&_nc_oc=Admjb6zV3reHepOLmThNRoxsI1YDXJnCT_JZ6c5OEp1-NNF9WNgJRnCSHxDE1MDmMVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvl8PKFQKmQrJD2LGakGMYMS16xr93XZNhc7HyBPwTIYw&oe=69A17AAC"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth